Detailed Description\par
\pard\plain 
{
\pard\plain \s17\sa60\sb30\widctlpar\qj \fs22\cgrid {\s17\sa60\sb30\widctlpar\qj \fs22\cgrid 
This uses the Fluidlite library to load soundfont files and play them. \par
}

{\s17\sa60\sb30\widctlpar\qj \fs22\cgrid 
By default it uses MIDI channel 1, though you can optionally specify a channel. To inspect or create soundfont files, I recommend the "Polyphone" app. \par
}}
