{
{\s17\sa60\sb30\widctlpar\qj \fs22\cgrid 
Get the internal buffer size. }}\par
{\s17\sa60\sb30\widctlpar\qj \fs22\cgrid 
The internal buffer size if not the same thing as the buffer size specified in the settings. Internally, the synth {\i always}  uses a specific buffer size independent of the buffer size used by the audio driver. The internal buffer size is normally 64 samples. The reason why it uses an internal buffer size is to allow audio drivers to call the synthesizer with a variable buffer length. The internal buffer size is useful for client who want to optimize their buffer sizes. \par
}}
