{\s17\sa60\sb30\widctlpar\qj \fs22\cgrid 
Destroys the {\b fluid_hashtable_t}. If keys and/or values are dynamically allocated, you should either free them first or create the {\b fluid_hashtable_t} using fluid_hashtable_new_full(). In the latter case the destroy functions you supplied will be called on all keys and values before destroying the {\b fluid_hashtable_t}. \par
}}
