{\s17\sa60\sb30\widctlpar\qj \fs22\cgrid 
: the function to call for each key/value pair. : user data to pass to the function.\par
Calls the given function for each of the key/value pairs in the {\b fluid_hashtable_t}. The function is passed the key and value of each pair, and the given  parameter. The hash table may not be modified while iterating over it (you can't add/remove items). To remove all items matching a predicate, use {\b fluid_hashtable_remove()}. \par
}}
